  "details": "Ugly line wrap and overflow happen on labels of \"Search For\" options, although there is enough space around them.\n\nThe label areas should be wide enough that the string appears in one line without line wrap.\n\n- String: \n\n    23821 `Worlds`\n\n    23823 `Avatar Worlds`\n\n    23825 `Users`\n\n- Language: Japanese\n\n- Translated:\n\n 23821 `ワールド`\n\n 23823 `アバターワールド`\n\n 23825 `ユーザー`\n\n- Build: l-test 1350\n\n- Location: `MM > Search > Enter a search term`",
